                                "sense_id": "a002e564-8a61-3ae9-8f13-81da4df95d12",
                                "text": "I think what we see here is a spiral of unconfidence because by listening to you, reporters and mass media people, I sense that you do not have a strong confidence about what you report and you don't have confidence to tell the government what to do ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd6b8a2a-8fc6-4f14-84b9-422207e8344a",
                                "sense_id": "a002e564-8a61-3ae9-8f13-81da4df95d12",
                                "text": "But feelings of confidence and unconfidence are essential guides to our cognitive efforts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "37ca5ab7-e64e-4258-a021-ef457bffe574",
                                "sense_id": "a002e564-8a61-3ae9-8f13-81da4df95d12",
                                "text": "Focusing on his Readiness, I wonder aloud if his feelings of 'unconfidence' can become an ally in his coaching, allowing him to use his own feelings of 'unconfidence' in the next session as an indicator that he's doing real work with Jane and enabling her shift back in the workplace."
                            }
